WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:02.101
- EXCUSE ME, SIR.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.469
DO YOU HAVE A MOMENT
TO SAVE THE CHILDREN?

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.904
- I'M SORRY, MAN.
I'M--I'M RUNNING LATE,

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.039
AND I JUST DON'T HAVE TIME
TO CHAT RIGHT NOW, SO...

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.573
- I UNDERSTAND THAT.
I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.208
IT'S JUST THAT, EVERY MINUTE,
ANOTHER CHILD

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.976
DIES UNNECESSARILY,
A CHILD WHO COULD LIVE

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:13.379
A FRUITFUL LIFE WITH THE HELP
OF JUST ONE SMALL DONATION.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.947
- YEAH, I'M--
I DON'T HAVE THE TIME.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.315
I'M SORRY.
- I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:21.253
IT'S JUST, ALL IT TAKES
IS $1 TO SAVE A CHILD.

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:23.356
- ALL RIGHT.
YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.758
FINE, YOU'RE RIGHT.
YUP.

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.392
WHO DOESN'T WANT
TO HELP A CHILD?

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:27.793
LET'S SAVE FIVE CHILDREN.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.796
- TOMMY!

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.507
ALL RIGHT,
COME ON, COME ON, COME ON.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:44.243
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR, FIVE.

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:48.514
NOT SO FAST.
JUST FIVE.

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:49.549
THANKS A LOT, SIR.
- HELP!

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.652
HELP!
HELP!

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:56.222
[indistinct shouting]

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.057
- OH, MY GOD.
I HAVE ANOTHER DOLLAR.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.858
I HAVE ANOTHER DOLLAR.
SIR, I HAVE ANOTHER DOLLAR.

00:00:59.858 --> 00:01:01.458
[haunting western music]

